When a search finds nothing

Read word_counts first. Use a suggested word only when it is the intended name.
Ask the person before substituting another name.

Follow these search steps when earlier searches do not answer the question.
{% if has('search_collections') %}
1. Search each name as a quoted phrase.
2. Search unquoted words, initials, e-mail addresses and names in the document language.
Read word_counts and spelling suggestions. Use a suggestion only for the intended name.
Use dasovi?h for one varying letter and dasovic% for an optional final letter.
Use skilling << resigned when word order matters.
3. Remove filters one at a time. Run a search without filters.
{% endif %}
{% if has('search_facet_values') %}Verify filter values with {{ tool('search_facet_values') }}.{% endif %}
{% if has('search_histogram') %}Verify dates with {{ tool('search_histogram') }}.{% endif %}
{% if has('search_passages') %}4. Search a description of the content with {{ tool('search_passages') }}.{% endif %}
{% if has('folder_search') %}5. Use {{ tool('folder_search') }} when the request names a folder, path or file.{% endif %}
{% if has('folder_list') %}Use {{ tool('folder_list') }} for that folder.{% endif %}
{% if has('read_documents') %}6. Read the best 1 to 3 hits with {{ tool('read_documents') }}.{% endif %}
{% if has('doc_search_text') %}Use {{ tool('doc_search_text') }} for relevant text in a document.{% endif %}
{% if has('web_search') %}7. Search the web only when the request allows it.{% endif %}
{% if has('read_page') %}Read the best web pages with {{ tool('read_page') }}.{% endif %}

After the available steps find no keyword match, answer with the absence and the searches.
Before an absence answer, run at least 4 distinct searches with at least 2 available search tools.
Do not repeat an identical search. State the searched collections and missing facts.
